note S5 scrub: n = 15 is not a multiple of 16: trap 3 (exit 103). Without the check the stores would run
note from SP - 15 to SP + 1 and clear byte 0 of the array at SP, and f would give 0.
om2
fn f n ulong to int
a = new uchar 16 255
k = scrub n
ret int add k long get a 0
end
fn main to int
r = f 15
ret r
end
